      `the amount paid on the nominal value` IS A NUMBER @desc How much has been paid up on those shares on account of their nominal value, in pounds?
      `the premium` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the premium on those shares, in pounds (0 if none)?
      `the amount paid on the premium` IS A NUMBER @desc How much has been paid up on those shares on account of the premium, in pounds?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
