    `s 91(1)(b) the allotment is paid up as the paragraph requires` (`coa2 seat an allotment` `the nominal value of the shares` `the amount paid on the nominal value` `the premium` `the amount paid on the premium` (Date 1 1 2000) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

@export Under section 91(1)(b) to (d), are the requirements as to how shares are paid up met for this allotment (taking account of what may be disregarded under section 91(2) and (3))?
GIVEN `the nominal value of the shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total nominal value of the shares in the allotment, in pounds?
      `the amount paid on the nominal value` IS A NUMBER @desc How much has been paid up on those shares on account of their nominal value, in pounds?
      `the premium` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the premium on those shares, in pounds (0 if none)?
      `the amount paid on the premium` IS A NUMBER @desc How much has been paid up on those shares on account of the premium, in pounds?
      `the date of the allotment` IS A DATE @desc On what date were the shares allotted?
      `allotted under an employees' share scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares allotted in pursuance of an employees' share scheme?
      `paid up by an undertaking to do work or perform services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the shares or any premium on them been paid up by an undertaking that someone should do work or perform services?
      `that undertaking has been performed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that undertaking been performed or otherwise discharged?
      `allotted for non-cash consideration including an undertaking to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares allotted otherwise than in cash, the consideration including an undertaking to the company (other than one for work or services)?
      `that undertaking to the company has been performed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that undertaking to the company been performed or otherwise discharged?
      `a contract provides for performance within five years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there a contract under which that undertaking is to be performed within five years from the time the special resolution is passed?
      `the place where the company was registered when the shares were allotted` IS A `Place of registration` @desc Where was the company registered at the time of the allotment? One of: `England and Wales`, Scotland, `Northern Ireland`.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 91(1)(b) to (d), are the share capital payment requirements met for this allotment` IS
    `s 91(1) the requirements of paragraphs (b) to (d) are met` (LIST (`coa2 seat an allotment` `the nominal value of the shares` `the amount paid on the nominal value` `the premium` `the amount paid on the premium` `the date of the allotment` `allotted under an employees' share scheme` `paid up by an undertaking to do work or perform services` `that undertaking has been performed` `allotted for non-cash consideration including an undertaking to the company` `that undertaking to the company has been performed` `a contract provides for performance within five years`)) `the place where the company was registered when the shares were allotted`

@export Under section 91(1)(a), is the nominal value of the company's allotted share capital, leaving out shares disregarded under section 91(2), not less than the authorised minimum?
GIVEN `the nominal value of the shares` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total nominal value of the shares in the allotment, in pounds?
      `the amount paid on the nominal value` IS A NUMBER @desc How much has been paid up on those shares on account of their nominal value, in pounds?
      `the premium` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the premium on those shares, in pounds (0 if none)?
      `the amount paid on the premium` IS A NUMBER @desc How much has been paid up on those shares on account of the premium, in pounds?
      `the date of the allotment` IS A DATE @desc On what date were the shares allotted?
      `allotted under an employees' share scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares allotted in pursuance of an employees' share scheme?
      `paid up by an undertaking to do work or perform services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the shares or any premium on them been paid up by an undertaking that someone should do work or perform services?
      `that undertaking has been performed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that undertaking been performed or otherwise discharged?
      `allotted for non-cash consideration including an undertaking to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were the shares allotted otherwise than in cash, the consideration including an undertaking to the company (other than one for work or services)?
      `that undertaking to the company has been performed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that undertaking to the company been performed or otherwise discharged?
      `a contract provides for performance within five years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there a contract under which that undertaking is to be performed within five years from the time the special resolution is passed?
      `the place where the company was registered when the shares were allotted` IS A `Place of registration` @desc Where was the company registered at the time of the allotment? One of: `England and Wales`, Scotland, `Northern Ireland`.
      `the authorised minimum` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the authorised minimum share capital for a public company, in pounds (section 763)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 91(1)(a), is the allotted share capital at least the authorised minimum` IS
    `s 91(1)(a) the nominal value of the allotted share capital is not less than the authorised minimum` (`s 91(4) the nominal value of the allotted share capital for paragraph (a)` (LIST (`coa2 seat an allotment` `the nominal value of the shares` `the amount paid on the nominal value` `the premium` `the amount paid on the premium` `the date of the allotment` `allotted under an employees' share scheme` `paid up by an undertaking to do work or perform services` `that undertaking has been performed` `allotted for non-cash consideration including an undertaking to the company` `that undertaking to the company has been performed` `a contract provides for performance within five years`)) `the place where the company was registered when the shares were allotted`) `the authorised minimum`

@export Under section 91(5), may my company be re-registered as a public company where it has resolved to reduce its share capital? (JUST FALSE where the reduction is made under section 626, supported by a solvency statement under section 643 or confirmed by the court under section 648, and leaves the nominal value of its allotted share capital below the authorised minimum; not covered otherwise)
GIVEN `the company has resolved to reduce its share capital` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the registrar that the company has resolved to reduce its share capital?
      `the reduction is made under section 626` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the reduction made under section 626 (redenomination of share capital)?
      `the reduction is supported by a solvency statement under section 643` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the reduction supported by a solvency statement in accordance with section 643?
      `the reduction has been confirmed by the court under section 648` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the reduction been confirmed by an order of the court under section 648?
      `the nominal value after the reduction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is, or will be, the nominal value of the allotted share capital after the reduction, in pounds?
      `the authorised minimum` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the authorised minimum share capital for a public company, in pounds (section 763)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 91(5), may my company be re-registered as a public company after resolving to reduce its share capital` IS
    `s 91(5) the company may be re-registered as a public company` `the company has resolved to reduce its share capital` (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `the reduction is made under section 626`) (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `the reduction is supported by a solvency statement under section 643`) (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `the reduction has been confirmed by the court under section 648`) `the nominal value after the reduction` `the authorised minimum`

@export Under section 92(1)(a), is the balance sheet prepared as at a date not more than seven months before the application for re-registration is delivered?
