      `the date the application is delivered` IS A DATE @desc On what date is the application delivered to the registrar?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 92(1)(a), is my balance sheet recent enough` IS
    `s 92(1)(a) the balance sheet is prepared as at a date not more than seven months before the application is delivered` `the balance sheet date` `the date the application is delivered`

@export Under section 92(3), is the auditor's report an "unqualified report"?
GIVEN `the balance sheet was prepared for a financial year` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the balance sheet prepared for a financial year of the company?
      `the report states the opinion that the balance sheet is properly prepared under this Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the report state the auditor's opinion that the balance sheet has been properly prepared in accordance with the requirements of this Act?
      `the report states the opinion under the provisions that would have applied` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the report state the auditor's opinion that the balance sheet has been properly prepared in accordance with the provisions of this Act which would have applied if it had been prepared for a financial year?
      `the report has a qualification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the auditor's report contain a qualification?
      `the auditor states the matter is not material` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the auditor state in the report that the matter giving rise to the qualification is not material for the purpose of determining whether net assets were not less than called-up share capital plus undistributable reserves?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 92(3), is the auditor's report an unqualified report` IS
    `s 92(3) the report is an unqualified report` `the balance sheet was prepared for a financial year` `the report states the opinion that the balance sheet is properly prepared under this Act` `the report states the opinion under the provisions that would have applied` (`s 92(5) a qualification is material` `the report has a qualification` `the auditor states the matter is not material`)

@export Under section 92(1)(c), what is the aggregate of the company's called-up share capital and undistributable reserves, in pounds?
GIVEN `the called-up share capital` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of the company's called-up share capital, in pounds?
      `the undistributable reserves` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of the company's undistributable reserves, in pounds (section 831)?
