    `s 92(1)(c) the aggregate of the company's called-up share capital and undistributable reserves` `the called-up share capital` `the undistributable reserves`

@export Under section 92(2), is there no change in the company's financial position, between the balance sheet date and the delivery of the application, that results in net assets becoming less than the aggregate of called-up share capital and undistributable reserves?
