      `the aggregate at the balance sheet date` IS A NUMBER @desc What was the aggregate of called-up share capital and undistributable reserves at that date, in pounds?
      `net assets when the application is delivered` IS A NUMBER @desc What are the company's net assets on the date the application is delivered, in pounds?
      `the aggregate when the application is delivered` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the aggregate of called-up share capital and undistributable reserves on that date, in pounds?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 92(2), is there no change in the company's financial position that makes net assets less than the aggregate` IS
    `s 92(2) there is no change in the company's financial position of the kind the subsection excludes` `net assets at the balance sheet date` `the aggregate at the balance sheet date` `net assets when the application is delivered` `the aggregate when the application is delivered`

@export Under section 93(2), may the registrar entertain my company's application for re-registration as a public company despite shares allotted for non-cash consideration since the balance sheet date?
GIVEN `shares were allotted since the balance sheet date for non-cash consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were shares allotted by the company between the balance sheet date and the passing of the resolution, as fully or partly paid up otherwise than in cash?
      `the independent valuation requirements of section 593(1) have been complied with` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have the requirements of section 593(1)(a) and (b) (independent valuation, valuer's report not more than six months before allotment) been complied with?
      `the allotment is in connection with a share exchange` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the allotment in connection with a share exchange (see the question on section 93(3))?
