DECIDE `Under section 93(2), may the registrar entertain our application despite recent non-cash allotments` IS
    `s 93(2) the registrar may entertain the application for re-registration` (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `shares were allotted since the balance sheet date for non-cash consideration`) (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `the independent valuation requirements of section 593(1) have been complied with`) (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `the allotment is in connection with a share exchange`) (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `there is a proposed merger`)

@export Under section 93(3), is the allotment in connection with a share exchange?
