      `no such application may be made given the numbers who consented or voted in favour` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Having regard to the number of members who consented to or voted in favour of the resolution, may no such application be made?
      `the period for such an application has expired` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the period within which such an application could be made expired?
      `the application has been withdrawn` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the application been withdrawn?
      `an order confirming the resolution has been delivered to the registrar` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has an order been made confirming the resolution and a copy of that order delivered to the registrar?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 97(2), are the conditions for re-registering as a private limited company met` IS
    `s 97(2) the conditions are met` `an application to cancel the resolution has been made` `no such application may be made given the numbers who consented or voted in favour` `the period for such an application has expired` `the application has been withdrawn` `an order confirming the resolution has been delivered to the registrar`

@export Under section 97(1), may my public company be re-registered as a private limited company?
