      `the conditions of section 97(2) are met` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the conditions of section 97(2) met (see the question on section 97(2))?
      `the application and documents have been delivered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has an application been delivered to the registrar in accordance with section 100, together with the other documents required by that section?
      `a statement of compliance has been delivered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a statement of compliance been delivered with the application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 97(1), may my public company be re-registered as a private limited company` IS
    `s 97(1) the public company may be re-registered as a private limited company` `the company is a public company` (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `the resolution is a special resolution`) (`coa2 seat a stated fact as an answer` `the conditions of section 97(2) are met`) `the application and documents have been delivered` `a statement of compliance has been delivered`

@export Under section 98(1), may I (with others) apply to the court to cancel a special resolution that a public company be re-registered as a private limited company?
GIVEN `a special resolution to re-register as a private limited company has been passed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a special resolution by the public company to be re-registered as a private limited company been passed?
