      `the nominal value held by the applicants` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value of the issued share capital (or of the class) held by the applicants, in pounds?
      `the nominal value of the issued share capital` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value of the company's issued share capital (or of that class), disregarding shares the company holds as treasury shares, in pounds?
      `the number of members applying` IS A NUMBER @desc How many members are applicants?
      `the number of members` IS A NUMBER @desc How many members does the company have?
      `an applicant consented or voted in favour` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has any of the applicants consented to or voted in favour of the resolution?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 98(1), may I and others apply to the court to cancel the resolution` IS
    `s 98(1) the applicants may apply to the court for the cancellation of the resolution` `a special resolution to re-register as a private limited company has been passed` `the company is limited by shares` `the nominal value held by the applicants` `the nominal value of the issued share capital` `the number of members applying` `the number of members` `an applicant consented or voted in favour`

