GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 122(3), may the bearer of a share warrant be treated as a member` MEANS
    `s 122(3) the bearer of a share warrant may be deemed a member of the company, to the full extent or for the purposes the articles define` `the articles of the company so provide`

@ref s 122(5)
@export Under section 122(5), is the company responsible for my loss from entering a bearer's name on the register?
