    `s 189(a) the provision is void to the extent of the contravention` `the company agreed to the provision` (IF `section 188 barred it` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)

@export Under section 189, is a long-term service contract deemed to contain a term entitling my company to end it at any time on reasonable notice if the company agreed to it without approval (s 189(b))?
GIVEN `the company agreed to the provision` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the company agree to the provision?
      `section 188 barred it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did section 188 bar the company from agreeing to the provision (the members' approval was needed and not given)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
