-- section 255(6)

@export Under section 255(6)(b), is a trustee of a trust not treated as connected with the director only because the beneficiaries include a body corporate with which the director is connected?
GIVEN `the beneficiaries of the trust include (or may include) a body corporate with which the director is connected` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the beneficiaries of the trust include (or may they include) a body corporate with which the director is connected?
      `that fact is the only reason the trustee would be treated as connected with the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that fact the only reason the trustee would be treated as connected with the director?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 255(6), is a trustee not treated as connected with me merely because the trust benefits my company, for the control test` IS
    (`s 255(6)(b) the trustee is not treated as connected with the director` `the beneficiaries of the trust include (or may include) a body corporate with which the director is connected` `that fact is the only reason the trustee would be treated as connected with the director`)

-- section 252(3)

@export Under section 252(3), does a person connected with a director include a person who is himself a director of the company?
GIVEN `the person is himself a director of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person himself a director of the company?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 252(3), am I, a director myself, among the persons connected with a director` IS
    (`s 252(3) a person connected with a director includes the person` `the person is himself a director of the company`)

-- section 252(2)(a)

@export Under section 252(2)(a), is a person connected with a director as a member of his family?
GIVEN `the person is the director's spouse or civil partner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the director's spouse or civil partner?
      `the person lives with the director as partner in an enduring family relationship` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the person live with the director as partner in an enduring family relationship (of the same or a different sex)?
      `the person is the director's child or step-child` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the director's child or step-child?
      `the person is a child or step-child of the director's partner, and not of the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a child or step-child of the director's partner (see the line above) who is not a child or step-child of the director?
      `the person is the director's parent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the director's parent?
      `the other person is the director's grandparent or grandchild, sister, brother, aunt or uncle, or nephew or niece` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the other person the director's grandparent or grandchild, sister, brother, aunt or uncle, or nephew or niece?
      `the child or step-child lives with the director and has not attained the age of 18` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the child or step-child live with the director and not yet have reached the age of 18?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 252(2)(a), am I connected with the director as a member of his family` IS
    (`s 252(2)(a) the person is connected with the director as a member of his family` (`s 253(2) the person is a member of the director's family` `the relationship` (`s 253(3) subsection (2)(b) applies to the person` `the other person is the director's grandparent or grandchild, sister, brother, aunt or uncle, or nephew or niece`) `the child or step-child lives with the director and has not attained the age of 18`))
    WHERE
        `the relationship` MEANS
            BRANCH
                IF `the person is the director's spouse or civil partner` THEN `s 253(2)(a) the director's spouse or civil partner`
                IF `the person lives with the director as partner in an enduring family relationship` THEN `s 253(2)(b) any other person (whether of a different sex or the same sex) with whom the director lives as partner in an enduring family relationship`
                IF `the person is the director's child or step-child` THEN `s 253(2)(c) the director's children or step-children`
                IF `the person is a child or step-child of the director's partner, and not of the director` THEN `s 253(2)(d) a child or step-child of a person within paragraph (b), who is not a child or step-child of the director`
                IF `the person is the director's parent` THEN `s 253(2)(e) the director's parents`
                OTHERWISE `s 253(2) some other relationship`

-- section 252(2)(b)

@export Under section 252(2)(b), is a body corporate connected with a director, because he is connected with it under section 254?
GIVEN `the nominal value of the shares comprised in the equity share capital of the body corporate in which he and the persons connected with him together are interested` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value, in pounds, of the shares in the equity share capital of the body corporate in which the director and persons connected with him together are interested?
      `the nominal value of the equity share capital of the body corporate` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value of the equity share capital of the body corporate, in pounds?
      `the share of the voting power at any general meeting of the body that he and the persons connected with him together are entitled to exercise or control` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the share of the voting power at any general meeting of the body that he and the persons connected with him together are entitled to exercise or control?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 252(2)(b), am I connected with the director as a body corporate he is connected with` IS
    (`s 252(2)(b) the person is connected with the director as a body corporate with which he is connected` (`s 254(2) the director is connected with the body corporate` `the nominal value of the shares comprised in the equity share capital of the body corporate in which he and the persons connected with him together are interested` `the nominal value of the equity share capital of the body corporate` `the share of the voting power at any general meeting of the body that he and the persons connected with him together are entitled to exercise or control`))

-- section 252(2)(c)

@export Under section 252(2)(c), is a person connected with a director when acting as trustee of a trust that benefits the director or a connected person, other than an employees' share scheme or a pension scheme?
GIVEN `the person acts in his capacity as trustee of a trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you acting in your capacity as trustee of a trust?
      `the beneficiaries of the trust include the director or a person who by virtue of paragraph (a) or (b) is connected with him` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the beneficiaries of the trust include the director or a person connected with him as a family member or a body corporate?
      `the terms of the trust confer a power on the trustees that may be exercised for the benefit of the director or any such person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the terms of the trust confer a power on the trustees that may be exercised for the benefit of the director or any such person?
      `the trust is for the purposes of an employees' share scheme or a pension scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the trust for the purposes of an employees' share scheme or a pension scheme?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 252(2)(c), am I connected with the director as a trustee` IS
    (`s 252(2)(c) the person is connected with the director as a trustee` `the person acts in his capacity as trustee of a trust` `the beneficiaries of the trust include the director or a person who by virtue of paragraph (a) or (b) is connected with him` `the terms of the trust confer a power on the trustees that may be exercised for the benefit of the director or any such person` `the trust is for the purposes of an employees' share scheme or a pension scheme`)

