-- section 252(2)(e)

@export Under section 252(2)(e), is a firm that is a legal person connected with a director when the director, or a person connected with him, is a partner in it?
GIVEN `the person is a firm that is a legal person under the law by which it is governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a firm that is a legal person under the law by which it is governed?
      `the director is a partner in the firm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the director a partner in the firm?
      `a partner in the firm is a person who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a partner in the firm a person connected with the director as a family member, body corporate or trustee?
      `a partner in the firm is a firm in which the director is a partner or in which there is a partner who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a partner in the firm itself a firm in which the director is a partner, or in which there is a partner connected with the director as a family member, body corporate or trustee?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 252(2)(e), am I connected with the director as a firm` IS
    (`s 252(2)(e) the person is connected with the director as a firm` `the person is a firm that is a legal person under the law by which it is governed` `the director is a partner in the firm` `a partner in the firm is a person who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director` `a partner in the firm is a firm in which the director is a partner or in which there is a partner who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director`)

-- section 252

@export Under section 252, is a person connected with a director (a member of his family, a body corporate he is connected with, a trustee of a trust for him or his family, a partner, or a firm in which he or a connected person is a partner), not including a person who is himself a director of the company?
GIVEN `the person is the director's spouse or civil partner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the director's spouse or civil partner?
      `the person lives with the director as partner in an enduring family relationship` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the person live with the director as partner in an enduring family relationship (of the same or a different sex)?
      `the person is the director's child or step-child` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person the director's child or step-child?
