      `the child or step-child lives with the director and has not attained the age of 18` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the child or step-child live with the director and not yet have reached the age of 18?
      `the nominal value of the shares comprised in the equity share capital of the body corporate in which he and the persons connected with him together are interested` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value, in pounds, of the shares in the equity share capital of the body corporate in which the director and persons connected with him together are interested?
      `the nominal value of the equity share capital of the body corporate` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the nominal value of the equity share capital of the body corporate, in pounds?
      `the share of the voting power at any general meeting of the body that he and the persons connected with him together are entitled to exercise or control` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the share of the voting power at any general meeting of the body that he and the persons connected with him together are entitled to exercise or control?
      `the person acts in his capacity as trustee of a trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you acting in your capacity as trustee of a trust?
      `the beneficiaries of the trust include the director or a person who by virtue of paragraph (a) or (b) is connected with him` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the beneficiaries of the trust include the director or a person connected with him as a family member or a body corporate?
      `the terms of the trust confer a power on the trustees that may be exercised for the benefit of the director or any such person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the terms of the trust confer a power on the trustees that may be exercised for the benefit of the director or any such person?
      `the trust is for the purposes of an employees' share scheme or a pension scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the trust for the purposes of an employees' share scheme or a pension scheme?
      `the person acts in his capacity as partner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you acting in your capacity as partner?
      `the person is a partner of the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a partner of the director?
      `the person is a partner of a person who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a partner of a person who is connected with the director as a family member, body corporate or trustee?
      `the person is a firm that is a legal person under the law by which it is governed` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person a firm that is a legal person under the law by which it is governed?
      `the director is a partner in the firm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the director a partner in the firm?
      `a partner in the firm is a person who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a partner in the firm a person connected with the director as a family member, body corporate or trustee?
      `a partner in the firm is a firm in which the director is a partner or in which there is a partner who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it so that a partner in the firm is a firm in which the director is a partner or in which there is a partner who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director?
