DECIDE `Under section 252, am I a person connected with the director` IS
    (`s 252 the person is connected with the director` (`s 252(3) a person connected with a director includes the person` `the person is himself a director of the company`) (`s 252(2)(a) the person is connected with the director as a member of his family` (`s 253(2) the person is a member of the director's family` `the relationship` (`s 253(3) subsection (2)(b) applies to the person` `the other person is the director's grandparent or grandchild, sister, brother, aunt or uncle, or nephew or niece`) `the child or step-child lives with the director and has not attained the age of 18`)) (`s 252(2)(b) the person is connected with the director as a body corporate with which he is connected` (`s 254(2) the director is connected with the body corporate` `the nominal value of the shares comprised in the equity share capital of the body corporate in which he and the persons connected with him together are interested` `the nominal value of the equity share capital of the body corporate` `the share of the voting power at any general meeting of the body that he and the persons connected with him together are entitled to exercise or control`)) (`s 252(2)(c) the person is connected with the director as a trustee` `the person acts in his capacity as trustee of a trust` `the beneficiaries of the trust include the director or a person who by virtue of paragraph (a) or (b) is connected with him` `the terms of the trust confer a power on the trustees that may be exercised for the benefit of the director or any such person` `the trust is for the purposes of an employees' share scheme or a pension scheme`) (`s 252(2)(d) the person is connected with the director as a partner` `the person acts in his capacity as partner` `the person is a partner of the director` `the person is a partner of a person who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director`) (`s 252(2)(e) the person is connected with the director as a firm` `the person is a firm that is a legal person under the law by which it is governed` `the director is a partner in the firm` `a partner in the firm is a person who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director` `a partner in the firm is a firm in which the director is a partner or in which there is a partner who by virtue of paragraph (a), (b) or (c) is connected with the director`))
    WHERE
        `the relationship` MEANS
