                IF `the person is the director's spouse or civil partner` THEN `s 253(2)(a) the director's spouse or civil partner`
                IF `the person lives with the director as partner in an enduring family relationship` THEN `s 253(2)(b) any other person (whether of a different sex or the same sex) with whom the director lives as partner in an enduring family relationship`
                IF `the person is the director's child or step-child` THEN `s 253(2)(c) the director's children or step-children`
                IF `the person is a child or step-child of the director's partner, and not of the director` THEN `s 253(2)(d) a child or step-child of a person within paragraph (b), who is not a child or step-child of the director`
                IF `the person is the director's parent` THEN `s 253(2)(e) the director's parents`
