GIVEN `one company is a subsidiary of the other` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is one of the two companies a subsidiary of the other?
      `both companies are subsidiaries of the same body corporate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are both companies subsidiaries of the same body corporate?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
