      `the claimant has continued as derivative proceedings proceedings raised by the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it so that the claimant has continued as derivative proceedings proceedings raised by the company?
      `the claimant has continued derivative proceedings under this section` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it so that the claimant has continued derivative proceedings under this section?
