@export Is there a quorum at the general meeting (section 318)?
GIVEN `the company is limited by shares or guarantee and has only one member` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your company limited by shares or guarantee, and does it have only one member?
      `the company's articles provide otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do your company's articles make a different provision about the quorum?
      `individual members present` IS A NUMBER @desc How many individuals who are members are present in person? (Up to 10.)
      `representatives of one corporation present` IS A NUMBER @desc How many persons are present only as authorised representatives of one and the same corporation? (Up to 10.)
      `proxies of one member present` IS A NUMBER @desc How many persons are present only as proxies of one and the same member? (Up to 10.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 318, is there a quorum at the meeting` MEANS
    IF `the company is limited by shares or guarantee and has only one member` THEN `s 318(1) one qualifying person present is a quorum` `the company is limited by shares or guarantee and has only one member` `the persons present` ELSE `s 318(2) two qualifying persons present are a quorum` `the company's articles provide otherwise` `the persons present`
    WHERE
        `the persons present` MEANS append (take `individual members present` `ten members`) (append (take `representatives of one corporation present` `ten representatives of one corporation`) (take `proxies of one member present` `ten proxies of one member`))
        `ten members` MEANS LIST (`s 318 person present` OF "M1", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M2", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M3", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M4", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M5", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M6", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M7", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M8", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M9", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "M10", TRUE, NOTHING, NOTHING)
        `ten representatives of one corporation` MEANS LIST (`s 318 person present` OF "R1", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R2", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R3", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R4", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R5", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R6", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R7", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R8", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R9", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING), (`s 318 person present` OF "R10", FALSE, JUST "the corporation", NOTHING)
        `ten proxies of one member` MEANS LIST (`s 318 person present` OF "P1", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P2", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P3", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P4", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P5", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P6", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P7", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P8", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P9", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member"), (`s 318 person present` OF "P10", FALSE, NOTHING, JUST "the member")

