DECIDE `Under section 420(1), have the directors of my quoted company prepared the directors' remuneration report for the financial year?` IS
    `s 420(1) the directors of the quoted company have prepared the directors' remuneration report for the financial year` (JUST `my company is a quoted company`) `the directors have prepared a directors' remuneration report for the financial year`

