      `I was a director of the company immediately before the end of the period for filing accounts and reports` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you a director of the company immediately before the end of the period for filing accounts and reports for the financial year?
      `I failed to take all reasonable steps for securing compliance with that requirement` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fail to take all reasonable steps for securing that a directors' remuneration report was prepared?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 420(2), do I commit an offence as a director because no directors' remuneration report was prepared?` IS
    `s 420(2) the person commits an offence` `the company has failed to comply with the requirement to prepare a directors' remuneration report` `I was a director of the company immediately before the end of the period for filing accounts and reports` `I failed to take all reasonable steps for securing compliance with that requirement`

-- Whose question: a director's of a quoted company.
@export What is the most a director can be fined on summary conviction of an offence under section 420, in pounds (section 420(3))?
