    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST penalty THEN
        CONSIDER penalty's `daily default fine for continued contravention`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST limit THEN `s 414D(3) the most a fine limit allows in pounds` limit 0 `level 3 on the standard scale, in pounds` -- placeholder: the statutory maximum is not used by this section, so a fixed 0 is passed

-- Whose question: a member's or debenture holder's.
@export Is a member or debenture holder of a quoted company entitled to be provided, on demand and without charge, with a copy of this document (section 432(1))?
GIVEN `my company is a quoted company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the company a quoted company?
      `I am a member of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a member of the company?
      `I am a holder of debentures of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you hold debentures of the company?
      `the company has a strategic report for the last financial year` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the company have a strategic report for the last financial year?
      `which document` IS A STRING @desc Which document? One of: annual accounts, directors' remuneration report, strategic report, directors' report, auditor's report.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 432(1), am I entitled, as a member or debenture holder of a quoted company, to a copy of this document on demand and without charge?` IS
    CONSIDER `which document`
    WHEN "annual accounts" THEN `s 432(1) the person is entitled to be provided, on demand and without charge, with a copy of the document` (JUST `my company is a quoted company`) (JUST `I am a member of the company`) `I am a holder of debentures of the company` `the company has a strategic report for the last financial year` `s 432(1)(a) the company's last annual accounts`
    WHEN "directors' remuneration report" THEN `s 432(1) the person is entitled to be provided, on demand and without charge, with a copy of the document` (JUST `my company is a quoted company`) (JUST `I am a member of the company`) `I am a holder of debentures of the company` `the company has a strategic report for the last financial year` `s 432(1)(b) the last directors' remuneration report`
    WHEN "strategic report" THEN `s 432(1) the person is entitled to be provided, on demand and without charge, with a copy of the document` (JUST `my company is a quoted company`) (JUST `I am a member of the company`) `I am a holder of debentures of the company` `the company has a strategic report for the last financial year` `s 432(1)(ba) the strategic report (if any) for the last financial year`
    WHEN "directors' report" THEN `s 432(1) the person is entitled to be provided, on demand and without charge, with a copy of the document` (JUST `my company is a quoted company`) (JUST `I am a member of the company`) `I am a holder of debentures of the company` `the company has a strategic report for the last financial year` `s 432(1)(c) the last directors' report`
    WHEN "auditor's report" THEN `s 432(1) the person is entitled to be provided, on demand and without charge, with a copy of the document` (JUST `my company is a quoted company`) (JUST `I am a member of the company`) `I am a holder of debentures of the company` `the company has a strategic report for the last financial year` `s 432(1)(d) the auditor's report on those accounts`
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- Whose question: a member's or debenture holder's.
@export How many copies of the documents is the person entitled to in all: a single copy under section 432, in addition to any copy under section 423 (section 432(2))?
