GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 433(4)(a), does my company commit an offence because a copy was published without the signatory's name?` IS
    `s 433(4)(a) the company commits an offence` `a copy is published without the required statement of the signatory's name`

