      `I am an officer of the company who is in default` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an officer of the company who is in default for this purpose? (Section 1121 says who is.)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 433(4)(b), do I commit an offence as an officer of the company in default because a copy was published without the signatory's name?` IS
    `s 433(4)(b) the officer of the company commits an offence` `a copy is published without the required statement of the signatory's name` (JUST `I am an officer of the company who is in default`)

