GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 434(2), is my company barred from publishing its statutory individual accounts without also publishing its statutory group accounts?` IS
    `s 434(2) the company is barred from publishing its statutory individual accounts for the year without also publishing with them its statutory group accounts` `the company prepares statutory group accounts for the financial year`

