GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 434(3), are these accounts my company's statutory accounts?` IS
    `s 434(3) the accounts are the company's statutory accounts` `the accounts are the company's accounts for a financial year as required to be delivered to the registrar under section 441`

