      `the end of the period the notice gave, or of any longer period the Secretary of State allowed` IS A DATE @desc What is the last day of the period the notice gave the directors, or of any longer period the Secretary of State has allowed?
      `the directors have given a satisfactory explanation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the Secretary of State that the directors have given a satisfactory explanation of the accounts or report?
      `the directors have revised the accounts or report so as to comply` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the Secretary of State that the directors have revised the accounts or report so as to comply with the requirements of the Act?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 455(4), may the Secretary of State apply to the court` IS
