      `my company was at some time in the year a Master Trust scheme funder` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was your company a scheme funder of a Master Trust scheme (section 39(1) of the Pension Schemes Act 2017 or the Northern Ireland Act of 2021) at any time in the financial year?
      `my company was at some time in the year a special register body` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was your company a special register body as defined in section 117(1) of the Trade Union and Labour Relations (Consolidation) Act 1992 at any time in the financial year?
      `my company was at some time in the year an employers' association` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was your company an employers' association as defined in section 122 of that Act or Article 4 of the Industrial Relations (Northern Ireland) Order 1992 at any time in the financial year?
