    `s 1129 the Companies Acts require the person to disclose the information` `the proceedings are against a person for an offence under the Companies Acts` `I am entitled to refuse to disclose the information on grounds of legal professional privilege`

-- Arises only if proceedings are brought against an unincorporated body, such as a club or association.
