      `a person is or was an officer, member or former member of my company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there a person who is, or has been, an officer, or a member or former member, of your company?
      `the same person is or was an officer, member or former member of the other company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that same person, or has that person been, an officer, or a member or former member, of the other company too (whether or not at the same time)?
      `my company is registered under that name` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your company registered under the Companies Act 2006 by that name?
      `the period for complying has not yet expired` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the period for complying with the direction or order not yet expired?
      `the direction or order was made before section 26 of the 2023 Act came fully into force` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the direction given, or the order made, before section 26 of the Economic Crime and Corporate Transparency Act 2023 came fully into force?
