            (IF `a person is or was an officer, member or former member of my company` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)
            (IF `the same person is or was an officer, member or former member of the other company` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE))
        (`s 1198B(2) subsection (1) prevents the other company using the name`
            `my company is registered under that name`
            `the period for complying has not yet expired`
            `the direction or order was made before section 26 of the 2023 Act came fully into force`)
